#: includes/class-plugin-options.php:69
msgid ""
"Test the connection between your WooCommerce store and the Plus Minus app."
msgstr "Тест на връзката между WooCommerce и сървъра на ПЛЮС МИНУС"

#: includes/class-plugin-options.php:73
